{"title":"解读重磅信号","date":"2017-01-09","content":"<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体\">解读重磅信号<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<br />\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">广州市政府工作报告刚刚出炉！<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">报告释放哪些重磅信号？<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:150%\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体\">以下为你一一解读！<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color:#0000ff;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\">报告释放哪些重磅信号？</span></b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:Helvetica;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 150%; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\nHelvetica;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">1</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">、实体经济</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:#4F81BD;mso-themecolor:accent1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">报告要点：</span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">建设黄埔、南沙、增城等<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>个先进制造业基地；大力发展物联网、云计算、人工智能等新技术；打造<span lang=\"EN-US\">5</span>个国际汽车零部件基地、互联网产业集聚区<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>一核五基十镇<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>和集成电路产业生态圈；重点发展商务、会展、科技、信息、物流等生产性服务业；着力发展文化、旅游、体育、健康等生活性服务业；加快基金小镇、财富小镇、绿色金融小镇等特色金融功能区建设；建设国际旅游目的地和集散地；加大对中小微企业扶持力度；建设<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>个民营企业（中小企业）创新产业化示范基地；培育更多<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>百年老店<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>等等。</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201701/775783b9dd8846c_%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.jpg\" style=\"height: 550px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18.6667px; line-height: 28px; width: 1200px;\" /></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt;\r\nmso-no-proof:yes\"><img height=\"197\" src=\"file:///C:/Users/xf3/AppData/Local/Temp/msohtmlclip1/01/clip_image002.jpg\" v:shapes=\"图片_x0020_14\" width=\"567\" /></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:#4F81BD;mso-themecolor:accent1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">解读：</span></b><b><u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&ldquo;</span></u></b><b><u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">着力振兴实体经济<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>在今年报告中单列一章，占了将近一千字的篇幅，足见分量。</span></u></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">报告明确提出<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>坚持市场导向，强化对实体经济的支持，形成四梁八柱更加稳固的产业支撑体系，提高整体竞争力<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>。具体从大力发展先进制造业，推动服务业高端发展培育具有核心竞争力的企业主体，营造实体经济良好发展环境四个方面进行了论述。</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">以日前富士康在增城投入<span lang=\"EN-US\">610</span>亿为例，为何郭台铭选择广州？他解释，广州的大数据、物联网产业近年来发展强劲，此次<span lang=\"EN-US\">SDP</span>同广州签约，通过<span lang=\"EN-US\">8K</span>影像不仅让大数据、物联网行业如虎添翼，未来还将继续加大对实体经济的投资。富士康未来将以珠三角为根据地，转型成为工业互联网、车联网龙头。<b><u>郭台铭提及几个关键词：实体经济、大数据及互联网产业，也是正广州未来重点目标。</u></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">2</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">、第二中央商务区</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:#4F81BD;mso-themecolor:accent1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">报告要点：</span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">谋划建设以国际金融城<span lang=\"EN-US\">&mdash;</span>黄埔临港经济区为核心的第二中央商务区。</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201701/121948393be90360445638_%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.jpg\" style=\"width: 1200px; height: 550px;\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:#4F81BD;mso-themecolor:accent1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">解读：</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">第二中央商务区<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>的说法在政府工作报告中第一次出现，黄埔临港经济区更是首次被纳入中央商务区建设体系。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">3</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">、第二机场</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:#4F81BD;mso-themecolor:accent1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">报告要点：</span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">开展第二机场规划选址。</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201701/true_%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.jpg\" style=\"width: 1200px; height: 550px;\" /></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:#4F81BD;mso-themecolor:accent1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">解读：</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&ldquo;</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">第二机场<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>曾经在<span lang=\"EN-US\">2013</span>年的政府工作报告中出现过一次，当时的表述是<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>初步完成第二机场规划选址论证<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>。时隔<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>年，第二机场的规划选址问题又一次被正式提出。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">4</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">、南沙</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:#4F81BD;mso-themecolor:accent1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">报告要点：</span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">哪个区被提得最多？南沙以<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>多次的露面频率遥遥领先。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201701/640_webp%20(1)_%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.jpg\" style=\"width: 1200px; height: 550px;\" /></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:#4F81BD;mso-themecolor:accent1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">解读：</span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">大多是在南沙自贸区、南沙新区、国际航运枢纽下属工程项目的语境下，还有一些提法也值得留意：跨境数据服务产业基地，南沙城市副中心，南沙凤凰湖等。<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>建设南沙城市副中心<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>被单列一节，用<span lang=\"EN-US\">195</span>个字的篇幅论述，在各区中绝无仅有。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">5</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">、经济目标</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:#4F81BD;mso-themecolor:accent1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">报告要点：</span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">经济社会发展主要预期目标是：地区生产总值增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">8%</span>左右，地方一般公共预算收入可比增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">7.8%</span>，固定资产投资增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">12%</span>，社会消费品零售总额增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">8%</span>左右，商品出口总值增长<span lang=\"EN-US\">2%</span>，城乡居民收入增长与经济增长基本同步，城市居民消费价格涨幅控制在<span lang=\"EN-US\">3%</span>，城镇登记失业率控制在<span lang=\"EN-US\">3.5%</span>以内，节能减排降碳约束性指标完成年度任务。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/8482ba15209b475ab73c26fc0c003d00/images/cms/article/201701/0157d22d15df30d_%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.jpg\" style=\"width: 1200px; height: 550px;\" /></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:#4F81BD;mso-themecolor:accent1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">解读：</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">2017</span><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">年地区生产总值的预增<span lang=\"EN-US\">8%</span>左右，与去年的目标相同。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:center;line-height:150%;\r\nmso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span style=\"color:#0000ff;\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">哪里会有机遇？</span></b></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">1</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">、一核五基十镇</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:\r\n16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:\r\n0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:#4F81BD;mso-themecolor:accent1;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">报告要点：</span></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">以琶洲互联网创新集聚区为核心，五大千亿级产业基地、十个互联网特色小镇为重点的互联网产业生态圈。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<!--[if mso & !supportInlineShapes & supportFields]><span\r\nlang=EN-US><span style='mso-element:field-begin;mso-field-lock:yes'></span><span\r\nstyle='mso-spacerun:yes'> </span>SHAPE <span\r\nstyle='mso-spacerun:yes'> </span>\\* MERGEFORMAT <span style='mso-element:field-separator'></span></span><![endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><!--[if gte vml 1]><v:rect id=\"矩形_x0020_8\" o:spid=\"_x0000_s1026\"\r\n alt=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/DI8daVYOkOia3rfLylPb2ZRh8BXHgfbXmt1xlrMRPJA2Jvc8RMqp1mUK2rdFxaQGI6tXmJwveUyhCicz9NavhN9A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1\"\r\n style='width:24pt;height:24pt;visibility:visible;mso-wrap-style:square;\r\n mso-left-percent:-10001;mso-top-percent:-10001;mso-position-horizontal:absolute;\r\n mso-position-horizontal-relative:char;mso-position-vertical:absolute;\r\n mso-position-vertical-relative:line;mso-left-percent:-10001;mso-top-percent:-10001;\r\n v-text-anchor:top' o:gfxdata=\"UEsDBBQABgAIAAAAIQC75UiUBQEAAB4CAAATAAAAW0NvbnRlbnRfVHlwZXNdLnhtbKSRvU7DMBSF\r\ndyTewfKKEqcMCKEmHfgZgaE8wMW+SSwc27JvS/v23KTJgkoXFsu+P+c7Ol5vDoMTe0zZBl/LVVlJ\r\ngV4HY31Xy4/tS3EvRSbwBlzwWMsjZrlprq/W22PELHjb51r2RPFBqax7HCCXIaLnThv