\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">其中，五大千亿级产业基地分别为：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">高唐泛娱乐产业基地、<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">花地河互联网商务产业基地、<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">新造智慧产业基地、<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">中新知识城大数据产业基地、<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">南沙跨境数据服务产业基地<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">十个互联网特色小镇分别为：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"li