" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\nnone windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm;background:#AAA695;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">楼市</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">合理增加住宅用地供应</span></u></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">，盘活城市闲置和低效用地，发展住房租赁市场，完善多层次住房供应体系，<b><u>加大调控力度，合理引导住房消费</u></b>，保持房地产市场平稳健康发展。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\nnone windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm;background:#AAA695;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">旧区改造</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><u><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:\r\n150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">重点推进<span lang=\"EN-US\">87</span>个老旧小区微改造</span></u></b><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">。加强城中村改造和城乡结合部整治。推动一批旧楼宇、产业特色小镇升级改造，整合提升村级工业园。深化城市更新事权下放，<b><u>搭建企业和社会资本参与城市更新平台</u></b>。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\nnone windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm;background:#AAA695;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">教育</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">继续加强学前和义务教育师资建设，认定教育专家<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>名、名校长<span lang=\"EN-US\">50</span>名、名教师<span lang=\"EN-US\">100</span>名，启动培养教育名家<span lang=\"EN-US\">40</span>名、名校长<span lang=\"EN-US\">50</span>名、名教师<span lang=\"EN-US\">400</span>名。<b><u>在全市所有中小学开展足球运动，组织开展市、区、校、班足球联赛。</u></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\nnone windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm;background:#AAA695;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">交通</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">力争年底前实现<b><u>九号线一期（飞鹅岭<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>高增）、四号线南延段（金州<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>南沙客运港）、十三号线首期（鱼珠<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>象颈岭）、知识城线（新和<span lang=\"EN-US\">-</span>镇龙）</u></b>的四条线路共<span lang=\"EN-US\">81.6</span>公里的开通。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:150%;mso-pagination:widow-orphan\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\nnone windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm;background:#AAA695;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">母婴室</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">母婴室建设今年首次被列入民生实事！并提出明确要求：加快推进重点公共场所母婴室建设，<b><u>年内建成<span lang=\"EN-US\">150</span>间以上母婴室，命名<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>间母婴室示范点。</u></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:14.0pt;\r\nline-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;border:none windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-alt:\r\nnone windowtext 0cm;padding:0cm;background:#AAA695;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">反电信诈骗</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:150%;font-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p align=\"left\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 150%;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14.0pt;line-height:150%;\r\nfont-family:宋体;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;mso-font-kerning:0pt\">防范打击电信网络诈骗今年首次列入民生实事。将加强广州市反电信网络诈骗中心建设<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>实时监控电信网络诈骗警情动态。派出流动监控车，及时发现打击伪基站。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>"}